          "title": "影子坐标怎么来",
          "markdown": "- 半径 $A$，夹角 $\\theta$\n- 直角三角形：$\\frac{x}{A} = \\cos\\theta$\n- $\\Rightarrow x = A\\cos\\theta$\n- 代入相位：$x = A\\cos(\\omega t + \\varphi)$",
          "layout": "follow"
        }
